# Production cron jobs run inside the `cron` Docker service.
#
# Start the stack (includes cron):
#   make docker-up-prod
#
# Schedule: docker/cron/crontab  (default timezone: Europe/Moscow)
# Logs:
#   docker compose -f docker-compose-production.yml --env-file production.env logs -f cron
#
# Host crontab is NOT required. The entries below are kept for reference only.

# 0 6 * * *  MOEX candles      -> asset_parser --incremental
# 30 6 * * * news parsing      -> news_parser --incremental
# 0 7 * * *  news enrichment   -> news_processor --incremental
